      ],
      "source": "https://www.berlin.de/en/districts/tempelhof/914935-6654133-lichtenrade.en.html",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During WWII a branch of Sachsenhausen concentration camp operated in Lichtenrade, holding Ukrainian POWs after 1941.",
